# Repo-root build/data dir only — DO NOT change to bare `sc_reconstruction/`
# (that pattern also matches src/sc_reconstruction/ and silently un-tracks
# package __init__.py files, which is what broke the metrics/models docs
# pages on RTD).
/sc_reconstruction/
analysis/data/forzen/
archive/
runs/
frozen

# Slurm + smoke-test artefacts (compute-node stdout / stderr / per-driver logs)
experiments/_smoke_logs/
**/_smoke_logs/
**/driver_logs/
**/cf_smoke_*/
**/st_smoke_*/
*.out
*.err
slurm-*.out
slurm_jupyter_*.txt
slurm_error_*.txt
**/logs/slurm/

# Hydra job outputs (per-run `.hydra/` and local outputs/ written by drivers)
**/.hydra/
**/multirun/
.venv*/
